# game/custom/mods/Courtyard/courtyard_scene.rpy:114
translate chinese_simplified courtyard_loop_cbaff0ad:

    # sill "I'm afraid [_cy_name] has already trained today. The body needs rest as much as drill."
    sill "恐怕 [_cy_name] 今天已经训练过了。身体既需要磨炼，也需要休息。"

translate chinese_simplified strings:
    old "The garden smells of fresh rain. One of the girls is humming somewhere in the corridors."
    new "花园里带着新雨的清新气息。有个女孩在走廊深处哼着歌。"
    old "A faint splash drifts over from the hot spring. Someone is enjoying her afternoon."
    new "温泉那边隐约传来泼水的声响。有人正享受着她的午后时光。"
    old "Soft laughter echoes from the training ground — practice, or gossip, hard to tell."
    new "训练场传来轻轻的笑声——是在练习，还是在说闲话，很难说。"
    old "The villa is quiet today. Books, needlework, and the occasional nap."
    new "别院今天很安静。读书、女红，偶尔打个盹。"

